**Every symbol, from Moh's own text.**

| symbol | Moh's definition | page |
|---|---|---|
| `δ_i` | logarithmic radius of `D_i`, Def 5.1(3): `δ_i = 1 − (n−M_i)∏_{j>i}[V_j(n−M_j)−d_j] / ((n−M_s−1)∏_{j>i}[V_j(n−M_{j−1})−d_j])` | 179 |
