+```
+
+so the bad group is used for descent.  Therefore:
+
+```text
+REFUTED: GLOBAL-INTERPOLATION/1.0 refuses a partial orbit.
+```
+
+The delivered preflight verifies distinct member count, bijectivity, one-cycle
