+| 13 | 1 | (273,182) | 70 | 19/48 | 1 | 48 | both | 65 | 24 | 17 |
+| 21 | 2 | (441,294) | 112 | 31/78 | 2 | 78 | (13) only | 105 | 39 | 27 |
+| 29 | 3 | (609,406) | 154 | 43/108 | 1 | 108 | both | 145 | 54 | 37 |
