+### 2.1 Proper, major-residual, and top-minor roots
+
+Each bottom star has `eV_2=3` roots and is fixed, after discwise
+normalization, by
+
+```text
+p_g(pi)=pi^3-pi,        p_f(pi)=pi^2-2/3.
+```
