+**Lane/date.** FIXED-N6 FAMILY, 2026-09-03.  **Status of new work:**
+`PROVED-HERE / UNREVIEWED` unless a narrower type is printed.  Computations
+labelled `WITNESS-ONLY` or `CONDITIONAL-MACRO` are not promoted to facts about
