+For the bottom increment the preceding lcm is `A_2`, and
+
+```text
+A_1=den(A_2*delta_1)
+   =den(7(5a+3)/2)
+   ={ 2, a even, L=5 mod 16;
+      1, a odd,  L=13 mod 16. }
