+no “largest `L` that fit”: none of the four full quadratic lifts passes the
+preflight.  The scalable direct GRS projections below ran in seconds and below
+22 MB.
+
+The frozen driver also has no command that emits an initial-form moment
+matrix, tropical bases, or a proper/non-proper Schur complement.  Its `rank`
