+## 2. Orbit-admissible packets and the corrected root ledger
+
+Branch-orbits v2 proves, for one orbit of bottom-major discs,
+
+```text
+|O|(D_1)=product_{j=2}^{s-1} omega_j,
+omega_j=A_j on (10),  omega_j=1 on (11).
