+the division in (9) is exactly
+
+```text
+5L = 1*A_2 + (5L+3)/4
+   = 1*(30a+18)+(10a+7).
+```
+
+Thus `triangle_2=1` and `square_2=10a+7`.  Condition (10) holds with
