+Condition (6) holds because `s=3` and `d_s=d_3=7>=4`.  The enumerator's
+top choice also has `0<V_3=5<d_3=7`, leaving top minor multiplicity two.
+
+At `r=3`, with `V_4=d_4=1`, condition (7) is exactly
