+```text
+rho=delta_2+1/(6A_2),
+```
+
+and gives every top-minor pair contact either `2` or `5/2`.  Both top choices
+have `ord D_i<-1`; the residual choice has `delta_2<rho<2/5` and also gives
+`ord D_i<-1`.  These facts are exact valuation algebra.
