+```text
+6L*(m-1)*(R*m+1).
+```
+
+| `L` | lower bound before products/inverses/times/evaluations |
+|---:|---:|
+| 5 | 5,218,470 |
+| 13 | 123,348,966 |
+| 21 | 1,693,244,070 |
+| 29 | 3,090,039,030 |
+
+Millions of SymPy symbols and equations already violate the intended 6 GB
+desk envelope at the first member; the later cases are orders of magnitude
+larger.  This is a structural preflight count, not an observed out-of-memory
