+```text
+2A_2-u=(5L-3)/2>0.
+```
+
+Therefore `t=1` is the only positive choice:
+
+```text
+k=A_2,                  N=A_2/2=15a+9,
+u-k=(5L+3)/4=10a+7=square_2<A_2.
+```
