+    sum tau_i^(r+1)/g_y(tau_i).  The monic-root identity makes all
+    homogeneous rows zero and the following monic row one.  The negative
+    fixture records the exact coefficient of t=x^-1 in 1/g_y.
+    """
+    tame = []
