+```text
+REFUTED: GLOBAL-INTERPOLATION/1.0 refuses a partial orbit.
+```
+
+The delivered preflight verifies the `(10),V2=1` packet type, exact rigid
+bottom star, distinct member count, bijectivity, one-cycle closure, the
