+(`branch-orbits-v2-grok46-20260903.md:192-266`).
+
+Here there is one `(10)`-only level, so
+
+```text
+|O|=A_2=30a+18.
+```
+
+If `t` copies of this one packet type are used, then
+
+```text
+k=tA_2,                 N=k V_2 q=tA_2/2,
+tA_2<=u.
