+
+| `L` | lower bound before products/inverses/times/evaluations |
+|---:|---:|
+| 5 | 5,218,470 |
+| 13 | 123,348,966 |
+| 21 | 1,693,244,070 |
+| 29 | 3,090,039,030 |
