+### 1.3 Condition (8): all radii
+
+The implemented Definition 5.1(3) formula is
+
+```text
+delta_i = 1 - (n-M_i)/(n-M_s-1)
+                 * product_{j>i}
+                   [V_j(n-M_j)-d_j]/[V_j(n-M_{j-1})-d_j].
+```
+
+Here
+
+```text
