+At the last level,
+
+```text
+[V_2(n-M_2)-d_2]/[V_2(n-M_1)-d_2]
+  =[7(5L-1)/4]/(28L)
+  =(5L-1)/(16L).
+```
+
+The product subtracted from one is therefore
+
+```text
+35L * (5L-1)/(16L) * 4/[21(5L-1)] = 5/12,
+```
+
+and
+
+```text
+delta_1=7/12.
+```
+
+All denominators used above are positive, and direct subtraction gives
