+Now `gcd(12a+7,6)=1`, and
+
+```text
+5(12a+7)-12(5a+3)=-1,
+```
+
+so the raw gcd is exactly four.  Hence
+
+```text
+A_2=3(5L-1)/4=30a+18=6(5a+3).
