+The top minor child contains
+
+```text
+n-ue=21L-15L=6L
+```
+
+roots.  The aggregate zero-charge/non-proper count requested in the charge is
+
+```text
+3(5L-k)+6L = 3(7L-k)=e(K-sum_B V_2(B)).
+```
+
