+```text
+2 | d V_2=2,            2 | e V_2-1=2.
+```
+
+If `A_1=1`, both printed alternatives hold trivially.  This degeneration of
+the bottom congruence is not an `(11)` zero-centre choice at `D_2 -> D_1`;
